    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to the experiment</strong><br>In this first-person psychological horror game full of pseudo random events, you will participate in an experiment confined in an apartment, your only contact with the world will be the talks with the person in charge of the study to check your progress, you must follow the instructions given by the person in charge of the experiment and distinguish if what you see while you explore the apartment and perform the tasks is real or is for your mental issue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871500/extras/dd0244c0cde4656c165731e386dc4834.avif?t=1717780903\" width=734 height=412 /></span><br><br>Explore the environment in this immersive psychological horror game, and keep in mind that the only way to overcome fear is to confront it directly.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871500/extras/2774b41d4caa65f50cc09e1664c10fd7.avif?t=1717780903\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Free 3D movement in a photorealistic environment full of jump scares.<br></li><li>Immersive horror experience both visually and narratively.<br></li><li>As the subject of the experiment you will answer certain questions to the person in charge of the experiment and depending on the answers will change the course of the story.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Welcome to the experiment</strong><br>In this first-person psychological horror game full of pseudo random events, you will participate in an experiment confined in an apartment, your only contact with the world will be the talks with the person in charge of the study to check your progress, you must follow the instructions given by the person in charge of the experiment and distinguish if what you see while you explore the apartment and perform the tasks is real or is for your mental issue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871500/extras/dd0244c0cde4656c165731e386dc4834.avif?t=1717780903\" width=734 height=412 /></span><br><br>Explore the environment in this immersive psychological horror game, and keep in mind that the only way to overcome fear is to confront it directly.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871500/extras/2774b41d4caa65f50cc09e1664c10fd7.avif?t=1717780903\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Free 3D movement in a photorealistic environment full of jump scares.<br></li><li>Immersive horror experience both visually and narratively.<br></li><li>As the subject of the experiment you will answer certain questions to the person in charge of the experiment and depending on the answers will change the course of the story.</li></ul>",
